---
// Author box component for blog posts
---

<div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
    <img
      src="/images/john_Fawkes.png"
      alt="John Fawkes"
      class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full object-cover object-top flex-shrink-0"
    />
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">About the Author</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>John Fawkes</strong> is a veteran copywriter with over 15 years of experience helping businesses turn attention into action through clear, persuasive writing. He writes about copy, psychology, and what actually moves people to buy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
